{
    "title": "onX Backcountry Trail Maps GPS",
    "description": "\u25b6The Ultimate GPS Map App for Your Outdoor Pursuits\r\nonX Backcountry lets you easily find and navigate new backcountry skiing lines, climbing routes, or hiking trails. Plan your hiking, snow skiing, and snowboarding trails with trail maps and trustworthy info, and navigate confidently with offline trail maps and GPS tracking.\r\n\r\n\u25b6Discover New Adventures\r\nWhether navigating trails, ski and snowboard routes, or backpacking trips, we\u2019ve got you covered with over 650k miles of hiking, skiing and biking trails.\r\n\r\n\u25b6Prep Better With Powerful Maps Tools\r\nWe adventure in three dimensions. With a 3D map, you can visualize mountain bike trails, scout skiing lines, and plan for hazards before you hit the hiking or ski trail. See recent conditions with weather forecasts, reports from other trail users, and get snow info from SNOTEL stations and regional avalanche forecasts to plan your snow skiing or snowboarding adventure. Map out custom hiking, mountain bike and skiing trails with snap-to-trail functionality, and use Waypoints, Slope Angle, Slope Aspect, Trail Slope, and Wildfire Layers for detailed route planning.\r\n\r\n\u25b6Hike, Ski, Bike & Navigate Without Cell Coverage\r\nSave Offline Trail Maps to bring your custom maps when you're outside cell coverage. With the onX Backcountry app, turn your phone into a handheld GPS device using your phone's internal GPS. Navigate hiking, skiing, and snowboarding trails offline by following the blue dot to always know how to get home. Leave a breadcrumb trail with Tracker to see where you\u2019ve been and measure your key trip stats.\r\n\r\n\u25b6The Best Snow Safety Tools\r\nGet the best maps to understand snow safety. Detailed snow information from SNOTEL sites, and critical slope angle, slope aspect, and ATES layers help you know the snow and plan your next skiing, snowboarding, or hiking adventure. \r\n\r\n\u25b6PREMIUM AND ELITE FEATURES:\r\n650,000+ miles of running, hiking, backpacking, ski, and mountain bike trails\r\n4,000+ backcountry skiing lines with guidebook descriptions\r\n300,000+ rock climbing routes with approach trails\r\nSnap-to-trail route builder to plan trips and see distance and elevation gain in seconds\r\nSave unlimited Offline Trail Maps for skiing, hiking and mountain bike trail map navigation without cell service\r\nGPS tracking to know where you came from, how to get back, and share your adventure\r\nLocalized weather conditions and 7-day weather forecasts\u2014ski and snowboard with confidence\r\n24K topographic maps and 3D maps for the entire U.S.\r\n985 million acres of Public Land across the U.S.\r\n550,000 Recreation Icons for points of interest, including trailheads, backcountry cabins and lookouts, campgrounds & dispersed camping land\r\nAvalanche forecasts for the U.S. & Canada\u2014helping you ski and snowboard safely\r\nPlan ski trips with recent snowfall information & historic trends via SNOTEL data\r\nThe best GPS trail maps to navigate on your backcountry climbing, and snow skiing trails\r\nPrivate Land Layer-ELITE ONLY: Private property maps & land boundaries, land ownership info, and acreage\r\nRecent Imagery-ELITE ONLY: Detailed satellite imagery from the past two weeks\r\n\r\n\u25b6Free Trial\r\nWhile the onX Backcountry App and many features are free, you\u2019ll start a free Premium or Elite trial when you install the app. You can try many of our best features, like 3D trail maps, unlimited offline downloads, trail info, and guidebook backcountry snow skiing lines. After the first seven days, you\u2019ll still have access to beautiful topo and satellite maps, GPS tracking, weather, and more.\r\n\r\n\u25b6Feedback\r\nIf you have any trouble or have an idea on what you\u2019d like to see next, contact us at support@onxmaps.com.  \r\n\r\n\u25b6 Your Four Season Adventure App\r\nWhether you\u2019re into hiking, snow skiing or backpacking, our app has everything you need to plan, navigate, and share your adventures. Download and start your next hiking, skiing, or camping journey with onX Backcountry. From offline maps to snow skiing routes, onX Backcountry has everything you need.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u25b6The Ultimate GPS Map App for Your Outdoor Pursuits<br>onX Backcountry lets you easily find and navigate new backcountry skiing lines, climbing routes, or hiking trails. Plan your hiking, snow skiing, and snowboarding trails with trail maps and trustworthy info, and navigate confidently with offline trail maps and GPS tracking.<br><br>\u25b6Discover New Adventures<br>Whether navigating trails, ski and snowboard routes, or backpacking trips, we\u2019ve got you covered with over 650k miles of hiking, skiing and biking trails.<br><br>\u25b6Prep Better With Powerful Maps Tools<br>We adventure in three dimensions. With a 3D map, you can visualize mountain bike trails, scout skiing lines, and plan for hazards before you hit the hiking or ski trail. See recent conditions with weather forecasts, reports from other trail users, and get snow info from SNOTEL stations and regional avalanche forecasts to plan your snow skiing or snowboarding adventure. Map out custom hiking, mountain bike and skiing trails with snap-to-trail functionality, and use Waypoints, Slope Angle, Slope Aspect, Trail Slope, and Wildfire Layers for detailed route planning.<br><br>\u25b6Hike, Ski, Bike &amp; Navigate Without Cell Coverage<br>Save Offline Trail Maps to bring your custom maps when you&#39;re outside cell coverage. With the onX Backcountry app, turn your phone into a handheld GPS device using your phone&#39;s internal GPS. Navigate hiking, skiing, and snowboarding trails offline by following the blue dot to always know how to get home. Leave a breadcrumb trail with Tracker to see where you\u2019ve been and measure your key trip stats.<br><br>\u25b6The Best Snow Safety Tools<br>Get the best maps to understand snow safety. Detailed snow information from SNOTEL sites, and critical slope angle, slope aspect, and ATES layers help you know the snow and plan your next skiing, snowboarding, or hiking adventure. <br><br>\u25b6PREMIUM AND ELITE FEATURES:<br>650,000+ miles of running, hiking, backpacking, ski, and mountain bike trails<br>4,000+ backcountry skiing lines with guidebook descriptions<br>300,000+ rock climbing routes with approach trails<br>Snap-to-trail route builder to plan trips and see distance and elevation gain in seconds<br>Save unlimited Offline Trail Maps for skiing, hiking and mountain bike trail map navigation without cell service<br>GPS tracking to know where you came from, how to get back, and share your adventure<br>Localized weather conditions and 7-day weather forecasts\u2014ski and snowboard with confidence<br>24K topographic maps and 3D maps for the entire U.S.<br>985 million acres of Public Land across the U.S.<br>550,000 Recreation Icons for points of interest, including trailheads, backcountry cabins and lookouts, campgrounds &amp; dispersed camping land<br>Avalanche forecasts for the U.S. &amp; Canada\u2014helping you ski and snowboard safely<br>Plan ski trips with recent snowfall information &amp; historic trends via SNOTEL data<br>The best GPS trail maps to navigate on your backcountry climbing, and snow skiing trails<br>Private Land Layer-ELITE ONLY: Private property maps &amp; land boundaries, land ownership info, and acreage<br>Recent Imagery-ELITE ONLY: Detailed satellite imagery from the past two weeks<br><br>\u25b6Free Trial<br>While the onX Backcountry App and many features are free, you\u2019ll start a free Premium or Elite trial when you install the app. You can try many of our best features, like 3D trail maps, unlimited offline downloads, trail info, and guidebook backcountry snow skiing lines. After the first seven days, you\u2019ll still have access to beautiful topo and satellite maps, GPS tracking, weather, and more.<br><br>\u25b6Feedback<br>If you have any trouble or have an idea on what you\u2019d like to see next, contact us at support@onxmaps.com.  <br><br>\u25b6 Your Four Season Adventure App<br>Whether you\u2019re into hiking, snow skiing or backpacking, our app has everything you need to plan, navigate, and share your adventures. Download and start your next hiking, skiing, or camping journey with onX Backcountry. From offline maps to snow skiing routes, onX Backcountry has everything you need.",
